"use strict";(self.webpackChunkchatgpt_shortcut=self.webpackChunkchatgpt_shortcut||[]).push([["14307"],{959005(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"id":13847,"title":"orca vs cubra","description":"The Orca vs. the Three\u2011Headed Cobra\\nDeep beneath the waves, legends spoke of a monster: a cobra with three heads, each dripping venom and glowing with fire. It slithered through the ocean trenches, claiming it was the smartest and strongest creature alive.\\n\\nBut one day, Ollie the Orca rose from the shimmering blue. He wasn\u2019t just strong \u2014 he was clever. Orcas are known as the \u201Cwolves of the sea,\u201D masters of teamwork and strategy. Ollie swam forward, ready to prove that brains can defeat brute force.\\n\\n\u2694\uFE0F The Clash\\nHead One struck like lightning. Ollie used echolocation clicks, mapping the cobra\u2019s movement, dodging with perfect timing.\\n\\nHead Two tried to coil around him. Ollie spun in circles, creating a bubble net trap that confused the snake.\\n\\nHead Three spat venom into the water. Ollie stirred up sand and coral, blinding the cobra\u2019s vision.\\n\\nThe cobra grew furious. It had power, but Ollie had IQ and strategy.\\n\\n\u{1F31F} The Victory\\nOllie remembered how orcas hunt together. He mimicked his pod\u2019s teamwork alone \u2014 luring the cobra into a maze of coral, trapping it in its own coils. With one final burst of sound waves, the cobra was overwhelmed.\\n\\nThe sea creatures cheered. The mythic captain narrator raised his trident and declared:\\n\u201CStrength fades, but wisdom wins. The orca is the true guardian of the ocean!\u201D\\n\\n\u{1F3A8} Epic Prompt for Your Generator\\n\u201CCinematic underwater battle scene: a mighty orca faces a mythic three\u2011headed cobra snake in glowing ocean trenches. The cobra is enormous, each head hissing venom with fiery eyes. The orca uses intelligence \u2014 echolocation waves, bubble nets, and clever maneuvers \u2014 to outsmart the cobra. Coral reefs, glowing runes, and sea creatures watch in awe. The atmosphere is heroic, vibrant, and mythic, showing that the orca wins with brain power and wisdom.\u201D\\n\\nThis way, you\u2019ve got both the story (to narrate or script) and the prompt (to generate visuals).\\n","owner":"chouaibboudarf.wac37","upvotes":1,"downvotes":0,"upvoteDifference":1,"updatedAt":"2026-06-15T00:31:29.543Z"}')}}]);